# Knowledge Graph Components

The project contains two main knowledge graph analysis components:

## Spotify Knowledge Graph
Located in `spotify-knowledge-graph-insights/`, this component:
- Defines domain models in `domains/spotify/`
- Implements graph algorithms in `knowledge_graph/`
- Provides visualization utilities in `src/visualization/`
- Contains song parameter analysis in `songs-parameters/`

Key visualization components:
- Data processors: `src/visualization/data_processors/`
- Plotting utilities: `src/visualization/plotters/`
- Visualization helpers: `src/visualization/utils/`

## YouTube Knowledge Graph
Located in `youtube-knowledge-graph-insights/`, this component:
- Contains analysis implementation in `analyzer/`
- Stores analysis outputs in timestamped directories under `analysis_reports/`
- Includes raw analysis files in `Youtube-Analysis-Files/`

## Integration Points
The knowledge graphs can be analyzed together through:
- Common data structures in the visualization components
- Shared analysis patterns between YouTube and Spotify data
- Combined insights in the analysis reports
